.env.local

# Bluesky CLI runtime artifacts written by bin/bootstrap-auth.ts,
# bin/post-daily-top3.ts, src/oauthStore.ts and src/stateStore.ts.
# The `.*` suffix catches every sibling the code can produce:
#   .bluesky-session.json        OAuth session blob (chmod 0600)
#   .bluesky-session.json.state  OAuth state store (chmod 0600)
#   .bluesky-session.json.did    DID summary written after bootstrap
#   .bluesky-session.json.tmp    atomic-rename leftover when a write crashes
#   .bluesky-state.json[.tmp]    posting-dedupe state + its atomic-rename temp
.bluesky-session.*
.bluesky-state.*

node_modules
*.log
